              "stdout": "<class 'str'>\n[{\"type\": \"web_search_result\", \"title\": \"Best International Schools in Vietnam (2025 Edition)\", \"url\": \"https://blog.doris.school/best-international-schools-vietnam\", \"content\": \"UNIS offers PYP, MYP, and DP as part of the IB continuum. The school serves a large international community and follows an inquiry-led curriculum across all levels. It is one of Hanoi\\u2019s longest-established IB schools.\\n\\n# Best International Schools in Vietnam (2025 Edition)\\n## Overview Table: International Schools in Vietnam\\n\\n| BIS Hanoi | Hanoi | British (IGCSE, A Levels) | Early Years\\u2013Secondary | Premium |\\n| UNIS Hanoi | Hanoi | IB (PYP\\u2013DP) | Early Years\\u2013Secondary | Premium |\\n| HIS | Hanoi | International + IB DP | Early Years\\u2013Secondary | Mid\\u2013Upper |\\n\\nPaul Hanoi | Hanoi | American (AP) | K\\u201312 | Mid\\u2013Upper |\\n| SIS @ Ciputra | Hanoi | Singapore\\u2013Cambridge | Early Years\\u2013Secondary | Mid |\\n\\n## United Nations International School Hanoi (UNIS Hanoi)\\n## International Schools Hanoi\\n\\nIt is one of Hanoi\\u2019s longest-established IB schools.\\n\\n## British International School Hanoi (BIS Hanoi)\\nBIS Hanoi delivers the British curriculum from Early Years to A Levels, with IGCSEs taken in secondary.\\n\\n## Hanoi International School (HIS)\\nHIS offers international programmes in primary and the IB Diploma Programme in the senior years. The school has a long history in Hanoi and a smaller campus environment.\\n\\nPaul American School Hanoi\\n\\n## Singapore International School (SIS @ Ciputra)\\n\\nView Singapore International School Hanoi\\n\\n| Curriculum Type | Schools Offering It | Notes |\\n\\n| IB (PYP\\u2013DP) | ISHCMC, EIS, UNIS Hanoi | Full continuum available |\\n| British (IGCSE + A Levels) | BIS HCMC, BIS Hanoi, Renaissance Saigon | Structured assessment model |\\n\\nPaul Hanoi | AP subjects vary by school |\", \"page_age\": \"174 days ago\"}, {\"type\": \"web_search_result\", \"title\": \"Expat Exchange - Best International Schools and Bilingual Schools in Hanoi\", \"url\": \"https://www.expatexchange.com/ctryguide/28891/119/Vietnam/Schools-in-Hanoi-Best-International-Schools-and-Bilingual-Schools-in-Hanoi\", \"content\": \"Among the most popular are the United Nations International School (UNIS) and the British International School (BIS), which are known for their diverse student bodies and robust curriculums.\\n\\n# Best International Schools and Bilingual Schools in Hanoi\\n\\n## United Nations International School (UNIS)\\nUNIS Hanoi is one of the leading **international schools** in the city, offering the International Baccalaureate (IB) program from the Early Years up to the Diploma level.\\n\\n## British International School (BIS)\\nThe British International School in Hanoi is part of the Nord Anglia Education family of schools.\\n\\n## Hanoi International School (HIS)\\nHanoi International School offers a multicultural environment with students from over 30 nationalities.\\n\\n## Concordia International School Hanoi\\n**Grades:** Pre-K through Grade \n",
